### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Jane", "lastName": "Doe", "email": "jane@office.test", "password": "demo-password" }

### Log in as a seeded admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "anna@office.test", "password": "demo-password" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Use the token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/equipment-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Who am I?
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin-only: works for anna (ADMIN), 403 for tom
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/equipment-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "SPEAKERPHONE", "name": "Speakerphone" }
